```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A([CLI Entry\nargs: dataset path]) --> B[DataLoader\nload_dataset]
    B --> C[SchemaInspector\nschema_inspect tool]
    C --> D{Schema\nValid?}
    D -- NO --> E([Abort: Invalid Dataset])
    D -- YES --> F[HypothesisGenerator\nClaude reasoning pass]
    F --> G[Rank Hypotheses\nclinical + data + simplicity]
    G --> H[Select Next Hypothesis]
    H --> I[QueryPlanner\nClaude tool_use]
    I --> J[SandboxExecutor\nexecute_query tool\nSQLite in-process]
    J --> K{Execution\nError?}
    K -- YES --> L[ErrorCorrector\nClaude self-correction]
    K -- NO --> M[ResultValidator\nvalidate_results tool]
    M --> N{Validation\nPassed?}
    N -- YES --> O[Analysis Complete\nappend to RunState]
    N -- NO --> L
    L --> P{Retry\nCount < 3?}
    P -- YES --> Q[Increment Retry\nLog Error]
    Q --> I
    P -- NO --> R[Abort Hypothesis\nLog Failure Chain]
    R --> S{More\nHypotheses?}
    O --> S
    S -- YES --> H
    S -- NO --> T{Min 3\nSuccessful?}
    T -- NO --> U([Abort Run\nInsufficient Analyses])
    T -- YES --> V[ReportWriter\nMarkdown + JSON + Figures]
    V --> W[OutputSaver\nsave_report tool\nPII hashing]
    W --> X([Run Complete\n/outputs/analysis_timestamp/])

    style A fill:#1e3a5f,color:#fff
    style X fill:#1e3a5f,color:#fff
    style E fill:#7f1d1d,color:#fff
    style U fill:#7f1d1d,color:#fff
    style L fill:#78350f,color:#fff
    style O fill:#14532d,color:#fff
```
